    "2": {
      "type": "Content",
      "is_root": "1",
      "node_name": "",
      "page_title": "Ask for documents",
      "content": "<p>${transforms.grouped_pnr_bucket_details}</p><p><br></p><div class=\"zt-content-block zt-cb-type-action\"><div class=\"zt-cb-title\"><i class=\"zt-cb-icon\" contenteditable=\"false\"></i><h3>Action</h3></div><div class=\"zt-cb-body\"><p>1. Send an email as \"Public reply\" in Zendesk to the customer to provide the necessary documents (passport and/or marriage certificate, based on the case)&nbsp;</p><p>2. Inform the customer on the deadline&nbsp;<br><br>3. Please remind the customer that the marriage certificate must be in English or the official language of the airline&nbsp;</p><p>4. Escalate the case to support.</p></div></div><p><br></p>",
